<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 14	May 13   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.210     270.980     247.020   10.20 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  311.200     310.540     306.830    1.42 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.480     159.595     158.970    0.32 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.374	47.344	47.182    0.41 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  446.000     440.380     419.180    6.40 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.845     141.885     141.685    0.11 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.188	16.126	16.185    0.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  229.370     227.500     212.430    7.97 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.891	 1.889	 1.888    0.16 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.584	 1.576	 1.581    0.19 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  188.180     188.885     183.135    2.75 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
